WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.268
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.736
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:04.637
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.539
The 75th Annual Emmy Awards

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.576
and the Iowa caucuses
were held on Monday.

00:00:09.576 --> 00:00:11.744
And in both cases,
the night's final award

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:13.913 line:0%
went to an angry man
with terrible children.

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:16.282 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.282 --> 00:00:18.550
President Biden this week
traveled to Philadelphia,

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:21.955
as presidents typically do
after a horrific disaster.

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.990
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:28.961
President Biden today met
with congressional leadership

00:00:28.961 --> 00:00:31.331
to discuss his request
for security funding,

00:00:31.331 --> 00:00:33.166
which includes money
for border security --

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:35.201
'cause every day
this guy is looking more

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.436
and more like a flight risk.

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:38.872
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:40.773
Vivek Ramaswamy
announced this week

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:42.875
that he was suspending
his presidential campaign.

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:44.744
He plans to return
to his true passion,

00:00:44.744 --> 00:00:47.413
tearing down the teen rec center
to build a shopping mall.

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:51.784
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.784 --> 00:00:54.186
You can do it.
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:54.186 --> 00:00:56.956
Former Arkansas Governor
Asa Hutchinson also announced

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:59.359
yesterday that he was suspending
his presidential campaign.

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:02.328
Did I say announced?
I meant muttered to himself.

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:03.962
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.962 --> 00:01:04.964
"What was that, Asa?"

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:06.032
[ Grumbles ]
"Aw, nothing.

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:08.568
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:09.869
No, I wasn't talking to you."

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:12.505
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:14.307
"Are you still running
for president, Asa?"

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:15.642
[ Grumbles ]
"None of your business."

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:17.744
[ Laughter ]

00:01:17.744 --> 00:01:19.545
In a new interview
with Fox News,

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:21.247
presidential candidate
Nikki Haley

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:24.650
said that the US has
"never been a racist country."

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.786
So if her campaign
doesn't pan out,

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:29.289
she could always get a job
teaching history in Florida.

00:01:29.289 --> 00:01:32.492
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:36.062
Democratic Senator
John Fetterman

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:38.898
is reportedly working
on a memoir titled "Unfettered,"

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:41.133
and I like that
every picture of him

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:43.202
looks like he just thought
of that title.

00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:45.205
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.239 --> 00:01:50.476
Pixar is reportedly planning
to lay off 20% of its workforce.

00:01:50.476 --> 00:01:53.579
Oh, come on!
The man just lost his wife.

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:56.248
[ Laughter, "awws" ]

00:01:56.248 --> 00:01:58.384
In 2009.

00:01:58.384 --> 00:02:02.455
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:07.159
Both a specious premise
and a huge bummer.

00:02:07.159 --> 00:02:11.130
That's what Mike Scollins
brings to a monologue joke.

00:02:11.130 --> 00:02:13.866
It doesn't quite track,
but everybody will be sad.

00:02:13.866 --> 00:02:16.769
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:19.639
A reptile wrangler in Australia
was recently called

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:21.540
after a mother
found a venomous snake

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.042
in her son's underwear drawer.

00:02:23.042 --> 00:02:24.777
Said her son,
"Uh, she didn't find

00:02:24.777 --> 00:02:26.079
anything else in there,
did she?

00:02:26.079 --> 00:02:29.215
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.418 --> 00:02:35.355
Um, apropos of nothing,
does weed kill snakes?"

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:38.424
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:41.026
The Michael Kors suit
worn by actress Nicole Kidman

00:02:41.026 --> 00:02:44.097
in the AMC pre-movie ad
is set to go up for auction

00:02:44.097 --> 00:02:47.433
and is expected to sell it
for up to -- for up to $10,000.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:50.069
Or you could just use that money
to go to the movies

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:51.037
and get a snack.

00:02:51.037 --> 00:02:53.806
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.806 --> 00:02:55.241
And finally,
Taco Bell has released

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:56.909
a new Cinnamon Twists cereal,

00:02:56.909 --> 00:02:58.878
which hopefully sells better
than their last one,

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:00.346
Tac-o's.

00:03:00.346 --> 00:03:02.482
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.482 --> 00:03:04.050
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

